# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing this tutorial, you can expect to understand the following information:\n"
"- How `qiskit-bosons` is organized: a bosonic model and its circuit are written once, independent of the mode truncation $d$ and\n"
"  of the level encoding, and a transpiler preset lowers them to qubits. This tutorial uses it for the simplest case, $d = 2$.\n"
"- Why hard-core bosons are the $d = 2$ case, how they relate to the Bose-Hubbard model and to free fermions, and why\n"
"  the 1D chain is classically easy while the 2D lattice is not.\n"
"- How to build the hopping Hamiltonian on a square lattice as a `BosonOperator` grouped by edge color, and the time-evolution circuit\n"
"  of a Trotter step as a `BosonicCircuit` that is independent of the lattice size.\n"
"- How the `qiskit-bosons` transpiler preset lowers that circuit to qubits for the four level encodings, and why the compact codes are\n"
"  an order of magnitude cheaper than the unary ones at $d = 2$.\n"
"- How to check the circuit against an exact reference, and how its Trotter error falls with the number of steps for first and\n"
"  second order.\n"
"- Why the natural embedding of the lattice into the square lattice of a Nighthawk chip needs no routing at any size that fits on the chip.\n"
"- What changes when you leave the hard-core limit: the same framework describes soft-core bosons, but the cost grows quickly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas melengkapkan tutorial ini, anda boleh dijangka memahami maklumat berikut:\n"
"- Bagaimana `qiskit-bosons` disusun: model bosonik dan litarnya ditulis sekali sahaja, bebas daripada pemangkasan mod $d$ dan\n"
"  pengekodan aras, dan pratetap Transpiler menurunkannya kepada qubit. Tutorial ini menggunakannya untuk kes paling mudah, $d = 2$.\n"
"- Mengapa boson teras keras ialah kes $d = 2$, bagaimana ia berkaitan dengan model Bose-Hubbard dan fermion bebas, dan mengapa\n"
"  rantai 1D mudah secara klasik manakala kekisi 2D tidak.\n"
"- Cara membina Hamiltonian lompatan pada kekisi segi empat sama sebagai `BosonOperator` yang dikumpulkan mengikut warna tepi, dan litar evolusi masa\n"
"  bagi satu langkah Trotter sebagai `BosonicCircuit` yang bebas daripada saiz kekisi.\n"
"- Bagaimana pratetap Transpiler `qiskit-bosons` menurunkan litar itu kepada qubit untuk empat pengekodan aras, dan mengapa kod padat\n"
"  lebih murah satu magnitud berbanding kod unari pada $d = 2$.\n"
"- Cara menyemak litar terhadap rujukan tepat, dan bagaimana ralat Trotternya menurun dengan bilangan langkah bagi tertib pertama dan\n"
"  kedua.\n"
"- Mengapa pembenaman semula jadi kekisi ke dalam kekisi segi empat sama cip Nighthawk tidak memerlukan penghalaan pada sebarang saiz yang muat pada cip.\n"
"- Apa yang berubah apabila anda meninggalkan had teras keras: rangka kerja yang sama memerihalkan boson teras lembut, tetapi kosnya meningkat dengan pantas.\n"

