# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. The model and the physics {#1-the-model-and-the-physics}"
msgstr "1. Model dan fizik {#1-the-model-and-the-physics}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$H = -t \\sum_{\\langle ij\\rangle} \\left(b_i^\\dagger b_j + b_j^\\dagger b_i\\right), \\qquad (b_i^\\dagger)^2 = 0 .$$\n"
msgstr "$$H = -t \\sum_{\\langle ij\\rangle} \\left(b_i^\\dagger b_j + b_j^\\dagger b_i\\right), \\qquad (b_i^\\dagger)^2 = 0 .$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this model, bosons hop between neighboring sites $\\langle ij\\rangle$ of a square lattice. In principle, a site can hold any number of bosons; however,\n"
"**hard-core** bosons are forbidden to share a site. Thus, every site holds either zero or one boson. In `qiskit-bosons`, that is handled through the\n"
"truncation $d = 2$ (`max_occupation = 1`) during the boson-to-qubit mapping. Each site is then mapped as a two-level system and the model is the spin-1/2 XY model,\n"
"$b_i^\\dagger b_j + \\mathrm{h.c.} = \\tfrac12(X_iX_j + Y_iY_j)$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam model ini, boson melompat antara tapak jiran $\\langle ij\\rangle$ pada kekisi segi empat sama. Pada dasarnya, sesuatu tapak boleh memuatkan sebarang bilangan boson; namun,\n"
"boson **teras keras** dilarang berkongsi tapak. Maka, setiap tapak memuatkan sama ada sifar atau satu boson. Dalam `qiskit-bosons`, ini dikendalikan melalui\n"
"pemangkasan $d = 2$ (`max_occupation = 1`) semasa pemetaan boson-ke-qubit. Setiap tapak kemudian dipetakan sebagai sistem dua aras dan modelnya ialah model XY spin-1/2,\n"
"$b_i^\\dagger b_j + \\mathrm{h.c.} = \\tfrac12(X_iX_j + Y_iY_j)$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**How this relates to the Bose-Hubbard model.** Bose-Hubbard adds an on-site repulsion $\\tfrac U2 n_i(n_i-1)$ to the hopping\n"
"term, which penalizes two bosons on one site. Hard-core is the limit $U \\to \\infty$, where double occupation is forbidden\n"
"outright. In the truncated space $n_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}$, $n_i(n_i-1) = 0$, so the on-site term vanishes whatever $U$ is\n"
"and the Hamiltonian has no interaction parameter at all. Note that this is the opposite of $U = 0$, which is the free\n"
"boson, where a site can hold many bosons.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Bagaimana ini berkaitan dengan model Bose-Hubbard.** Bose-Hubbard menambah tolakan atas tapak $\\tfrac U2 n_i(n_i-1)$ pada sebutan\n"
"lompatan, yang menghukum dua boson pada satu tapak. Teras keras ialah had $U \\to \\infty$, yang mana pendudukan berganda dilarang\n"
"sepenuhnya. Dalam ruang terpangkas $n_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}$, $n_i(n_i-1) = 0$, jadi sebutan atas tapak lenyap apa pun $U$\n"
"dan Hamiltonian tidak mempunyai parameter interaksi langsung. Perhatikan bahawa ini bertentangan dengan $U = 0$, iaitu boson\n"
"bebas, yang mana sesuatu tapak boleh memuatkan banyak boson.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Why 1D is classically easy and 2D is not.** On an open chain, hard-core bosons are exactly free fermions: the Jordan-Wigner\n"
"transformation turns the spin chain into a quadratic fermion Hamiltonian with no string left over, because particles\n"
"cannot hop past each other. On a grid, a hop around a plaquette exchanges particles, and the sign that the fermions would pick up\n"
"is not matched by the bosons. The cells below check this with `qiskit-fermions`: they build free fermions that hop on the same\n"
"bonds, map them with `jordan_wigner` (qubit $j$ is mode $j$, sites numbered row by row) and compare the spectra with\n"
"the hard-core Hamiltonian in every particle-number sector. The hard-core matrix itself is built with plain numpy, because\n"
"it is a boson model.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mengapa 1D mudah secara klasik dan 2D tidak.** Pada rantai terbuka, boson teras keras adalah tepat fermion bebas: penjelmaan\n"
"Jordan-Wigner mengubah rantai spin menjadi Hamiltonian fermion kuadratik tanpa rentetan yang tinggal, kerana zarah\n"
"tidak boleh melompat melepasi satu sama lain. Pada grid, lompatan mengelilingi satu plakuet menukar zarah, dan tanda yang akan diperoleh fermion\n"
"tidak dipadankan oleh boson. Sel di bawah menyemak ini dengan `qiskit-fermions`: ia membina fermion bebas yang melompat pada\n"
"ikatan yang sama, memetakannya dengan `jordan_wigner` (qubit $j$ ialah mod $j$, tapak dinomborkan baris demi baris) dan membandingkan spektrum dengan\n"
"Hamiltonian teras keras dalam setiap sektor nombor zarah. Matriks teras keras itu sendiri dibina dengan numpy biasa, kerana\n"
"ia ialah model boson.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the open chain, the two Hamiltonians are the same matrix and the spectra agree to rounding in every sector. On the grids,\n"
"they differ at order one, and the ring with an even particle number fails too, because particles can circle around it. So the\n"
"1D case is classically easy (free fermions are a polynomial problem) and the 2D case is the interesting one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada rantai terbuka, kedua-dua Hamiltonian ialah matriks yang sama dan spektrum selaras sehingga pembundaran dalam setiap sektor. Pada grid,\n"
"ia berbeza pada tertib satu, dan gelang dengan nombor zarah genap juga gagal, kerana zarah boleh beredar mengelilinginya. Jadi\n"
"kes 1D mudah secara klasik (fermion bebas ialah masalah polinomial) dan kes 2D ialah yang menarik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Build the `BosonicCircuit` {#2-build-the-bosoniccircuit}"
msgstr "2. Bina `BosonicCircuit` {#2-build-the-bosoniccircuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A hopping term is Hermitian only together with its conjugate pair, so both stay in one group. Bonds that share no site commute, so an\n"
"**edge coloring** of the square lattice gives groups that commute internally at the bosonic level:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebutan lompatan adalah Hermitian hanya bersama pasangan konjugatnya, jadi kedua-duanya kekal dalam satu kumpulan. Ikatan yang tidak berkongsi tapak saling kekomutatif, jadi\n"
"**pewarnaan tepi** kekisi segi empat sama memberikan kumpulan yang kekomutatif secara dalaman pada peringkat bosonik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "color 0 / 1: horizontal bonds starting at an even / odd column (blue pair)\n"
msgstr "warna 0 / 1: ikatan mengufuk bermula pada lajur genap / ganjil (pasangan biru)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "color 2 / 3: vertical bonds starting at an even / odd row (orange and red)\n"
msgstr "warna 2 / 3: ikatan menegak bermula pada baris genap / ganjil (jingga dan merah)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two bonds of the same color never share a site, because the bonds along a line alternate colors. The construction below takes\n"
"only the lattice size $(L_x, L_y)$ as input, and everything after it (circuit, encoding, transpilation) is identical for every\n"
"size. The drawing shows the site numbering ($s = L_x y + x$) and the colors for a $4\\times4$ lattice.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dua ikatan dengan warna yang sama tidak pernah berkongsi tapak, kerana ikatan sepanjang satu garisan berselang-seli warna. Pembinaan di bawah mengambil\n"
"hanya saiz kekisi $(L_x, L_y)$ sebagai input, dan segala-galanya selepas itu (litar, pengekodan, transpilasi) adalah sama untuk setiap\n"
"saiz. Lukisan menunjukkan penomboran tapak ($s = L_x y + x$) dan warna bagi kekisi $4\\times4$.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/hard-core-bosons-dynamics/extracted-outputs/57d33dfd-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/hard-core-bosons-dynamics/extracted-outputs/57d33dfd-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run some simple checks of the construction on a few lattices: every color group is Hermitian, and the bonds of a color are site-disjoint (so each group commutes internally).\n"
msgstr "Jalankan beberapa semakan mudah pada pembinaan ini pada beberapa kekisi: setiap kumpulan warna ialah Hermitian, dan ikatan sesuatu warna tidak bersentuhan tapak (jadi setiap kumpulan kekomutatif secara dalaman).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now construct the circuit. The whole Trotter step is **one** `Evolution` gate over all modes. `BosonicLieTrotter` decides how it splits,\n"
"and one `decompose()` shows the split: one `Evolution` per color and per Trotter step. The circuit mentions neither the\n"
"truncation nor the encoding; those come in when the transpiler preset lowers it to qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang bina litar. Seluruh langkah Trotter ialah **satu** get `Evolution` ke atas semua mod. `BosonicLieTrotter` menentukan bagaimana ia dipecahkan,\n"
"dan satu `decompose()` menunjukkan pemecahan itu: satu `Evolution` bagi setiap warna dan setiap langkah Trotter. Litar tidak menyebut\n"
"pemangkasan mahupun pengekodan; perkara itu masuk apabila pratetap Transpiler menurunkannya kepada qubit.\n"

